{"id":"n24520-3-8","stage":1,"title":"불편 · 不自在","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24520-3-8-1","ko":"난 민준이랑 둘만 있는 게 너무 어색해.","zh":"我和敏俊两个人单独相处，真的觉得太尴尬了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"난","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"민준이랑","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；이：名词后缀，构成派生名词。；랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"민준이랑","audio":"/audio/51fe8c7e5b3a50dbeb63.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"둘만","meaning":"二","explanation":"둘：二；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"둘","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"34869","senseId":"1","lemma":"둘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"在，待，住","explanation":"있다：在，待，住；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"9","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어색해.","meaning":"尴尬，拘束","explanation":"어색하다：尴尬，拘束；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"어색하다","audio":"/audio/faaa76ed2a5783e1c80c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67014","senseId":"1","lemma":"어색하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"ca76b1284fc2088d","term":"둘","zh":"二","audio":"/audio/ca76b1284fc2088d64d7.mp3","entryId":"34869","definition":"一加一后所得的数目。","pronunciation":["둘ː"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"在，待，住","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"人或动物停留或居住在某个地方。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"faaa76ed2a5783e1","term":"어색하다","zh":"尴尬，拘束","audio":"/audio/faaa76ed2a5783e1c80c.mp3","entryId":"67014","definition":"和不了解或并不想见的人相对而不舒服或不自然。","pronunciation":["어ː새카다"]}],"audio":"/audio/538525e7f1fbafe8aad9.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n24520-3-8-2","ko":"불편을 느끼는 게 너만은 아닐 거야.","zh":"感到不舒服的应该不只是你一个人吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"불편을","meaning":"不自在","explanation":"불편：不自在；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"불편","audio":"/audio/0245b4f090ae2583141e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24520","senseId":"3","lemma":"불편","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"느끼는","meaning":"感受，觉得，感到","explanation":"느끼다：感受，觉得，感到；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"느끼다","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64376","senseId":"2","lemma":"느끼다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","explanation":"것：表示某种行为、状态或事情。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"4","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너만은","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；만：表示“只、仅”。；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아닐","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"아닐","audio":"/audio/afd7e40742400b8d366e.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"0245b4f090ae2583","term":"불편","zh":"不自在","audio":"/audio/0245b4f090ae2583141e.mp3","entryId":"24520","definition":"与他人的关系等别扭。","pronunciation":["불편"]},{"id":"11a4151b77b606b8","term":"느끼다","zh":"感受，觉得，感到","audio":"/audio/11a4151b77b606b85dcc.mp3","entryId":"64376","definition":"内心经历某种情感。","pronunciation":["느끼다"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示某种行为、状态或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/f651c2dc78dd2c6a7f32.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.61,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=24520","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"3","sourceLevel":"초급","day":54,"sequenceScore":2.4367,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["感到不舒服的应该不只是你一个人吧。","裕敏啊，你知道明天有考试吗？","我和敏俊两个人单独相处，真的觉得太尴尬了。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["感到不舒服的应该不只是你一个人吧。","我和敏俊两个人单独相处，真的觉得太尴尬了。","裕敏啊，你知道明天有考试吗？"],"answer":0}]}
